  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Great thief ghost hand pulls a rank seven Immortal Gu from Yi Yang’s immortal aperture. After Fang Yuan refines it, he recognizes the Gu as Space Travel, a space path Immortal Gu with a remarkable movement ability. Shadow Sect true inheritances record that it was initially captured from the body of an immemorial desolate beast level pegasus. Fang Yuan stores it even though he does not cultivate space path and has ordinary attainment and few space path dao marks; he plans to use other true inheritances, killer moves, and recipes to make use of it.",
        "chapters": [
          1608
